          Ready to turn your inclusion intentions into impact? Get in touch with our team today to discuss how we can tailor our primary research and strategic insights to your firm.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://extense.co.uk/contact" css-class="hover-gold" inner-padding="16px 50px">
          Submit An Enquiry
        </mj-button>
